<title>GERMANY: Rheinmetall-has discussed Kolbenschmidt with T&amp;N.</title>
<headline>Rheinmetall-has discussed Kolbenschmidt with T&amp;N.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering and defence group Rheinmetall said on Wednesday it had held discussions with British auto components group T&amp;N Plc about T&amp;N's stake in Kolbenschmidt AG.</p>
<p>&quot;We have had talks with T&amp;N about this quite recently,&quot; a Rheinmetall spokesman said in response to enquiries. The German group earlier announced it was purchasing a 24.99 percent stake in Kolbenschmidt, a German producer of car components.</p>
</text>
